{"lyrics":"[00:00.38]Uh-huh, yeah-yeah\n[00:06.04]Juice is eating a, uh, ice cream\n[00:08.52]With, uh, lots of caramel (bitch)\n[00:10.28]I just had a ice cream sandwich, M&Ms\n[00:15.30]On a Eminem beat, ironically\n[00:18.40]Yeah-yeah, three years\n[00:19.90]Uh, uh, okay\n[00:23.36]I'm the type to come in the game and just launch pain\n[00:25.66]With a bronze frame and a tattoo of my mom's name\n[00:28.28]This industry has nothing to offer beyond fame\n[00:31.00]Time to take these niggas to school, LeBron James\n[00:33.34]Lesson one, I'm a bad teacher who gave the class seizures\n[00:36.46]Smash divas, stash reefer in the lab freezer\n[00:38.70]I found the reefer Cordae stashed in the back of the lab\n[00:41.12]So I'm in class, smokin' gas, slappin' the class preacher\n[00:43.86]Bring the house down on you hoes, Queen Latifah\n[00:46.22]I'm too fast, gettin' this cash\n[00:47.96]Get in the way, get your brain bashed\n[00:49.66]Chopper gon' smash, hittin' your face\n[00:51.36]I'ma tie up, just like a shoe, my flow laced\n[00:53.72]Y'all niggas so fake, wash your face in my showcase\n[00:56.36]Fresher than Colgate, make hoes wait, I hold weight\n[00:58.94]Bottle of Rosé in the Rolls, drivin' with road rage\n[01:01.68]For ten days, off Xans, just tryna get paid\n[01:04.08]And since the sixth grade I been great, no sensei\n[01:06.72]My rent paid for ten days 'cause my pen's great\n[01:09.26]I smoke ten Js with two hoes that go both ways\n[01:12.26]Funny how two plus two equals foreplay\n[01:14.74]Speakin' of foreplay, had this shit in the hallway with\n[01:17.22]A nun on Sunday, I guess I'm just too blessed (whoa, ayy)\n[01:19.98]Me and my nigga Juice WRLD takin' over the Universe\n[01:22.48]You knew it first, got my mom Chanel with the newest purse\n[01:25.12]Birkin bag, never hurt to ask, \"What type of purse is that?\"\n[01:27.66]Something that's very fuckin' expensive, I deserve to brag\n[01:30.52]I murder tracks, this isn't mumble, it's murder rap\n[01:32.78]Type of shit your grandma understand with her old ass\n[01:35.38]Spend a half a million, then go back and make some more cash\n[01:37.84]The hair trigger Brazilian, you would get your whole hood waxed\n[01:39.50]See, what you know about my life and my troubled past?\n[01:41.88]Took the shuttle pass, hit the mall, I got double cash, copped the duffle bag\n[01:45.42]Ten bands on my fuckin' ass, that's a subtle brag\n[01:48.00]Hi Level, we be makin' moves, hit the huddle fast, ah\n[01:50.54]Break the huddle, get a sack, that's a fumble on the play\n[01:53.22]Not in my house, he look like Mutombo in the face\n[01:55.70]Leave him spinnin' like a funnel cloud with lightning and some thunder\n[01:58.28]Like the Wizard of O-Z, the way we carry him away (uh)\n[02:01.18]Carry him, then bury him, barbarian\n[02:03.72]Beef with anybody, even if you vegetarian\n[02:06.12]My flow on ebola, your flow just need Claritin\n[02:08.92]Runnin' laps 'round these chaps, it's embarrassin'","words":[[0.38,1.92,"Uh-huh,"],[2.96,3.38,"yeah-yeah"],[6.04,6.3,"Juice"],[6.34,6.4,"is"],[6.54,6.76,"eating"],[6.8,6.8,"a,"],[6.94,7.54,"uh,"],[7.64,7.74,"ice"],[7.8,8.04,"cream"],[8.52,8.66,"With,"],[8.72,9.12,"uh,"],[9.16,9.34,"lots"],[9.38,9.42,"of"],[9.48,9.72,"caramel"],[9.78,9.86,"(bitch)"],[10.28,10.28,"I"],[10.34,10.44,"just"],[10.48,10.66,"had"],[11.56,11.56,"a"],[11.78,11.88,"ice"],[11.94,12.14,"cream"],[12.24,12.68,"sandwich,"],[13.4,13.78,"M&Ms"],[15.3,15.38,"On"],[15.42,15.42,"a"],[15.5,15.76,"Eminem"],[15.84,15.96,"beat,"],[16.82,17.24,"ironically"],[18.4,18.74,"Yeah-yeah,"],[19.58,19.72,"three"],[19.76,19.86,"years"],[19.9,19.92,"Uh,"],[19.96,20.02,"uh,"],[22.8,23.06,"okay"],[23.36,23.4,"I'm"],[23.46,23.5,"the"],[23.58,23.78,"type"],[23.82,23.86,"to"],[23.94,24.12,"come"],[24.18,24.2,"in"],[24.24,24.28,"the"],[24.4,24.62,"game"],[24.66,24.7,"and"],[24.74,24.86,"just"],[24.92,25.12,"launch"],[25.22,25.56,"pain"],[25.66,25.76,"With"],[25.8,25.8,"a"],[25.84,26.16,"bronze"],[26.22,26.52,"frame"]